{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28068","headline":"秋晚日少陵原游山泉之什 · 杨发","name":"秋晚日少陵原游山泉之什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"喧浊侵肌性未沈，每来云外恣幽寻。\n尘衣更喜秋泉洁，倦迹方依竹洞深。\n暂过偶然应系分，有期终去但劳心。\n唯怜一夜空山月，似许他年伴独吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨发","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28068.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28068","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}